  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/he-p/4030",
  "definition": "Specific Licenses, Requirements for Issuance",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-01-15",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for He-P 4030) #6942, eff 2-1-99; amd by #8488, eff 11-18-05; amd by #8800, INTERIM, eff 2-1-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-07 New. #8959, eff 8-7-07; ss by #10896, INTERIM, eff 7-22-15, EXPIRES: 1-18-16; ss by #11006, eff 1-15-16",
